        <h2>Common Questions</h2>

        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Is this backed by real evidence?</strong> Yes. The
            <a href="/library/">RRM Academy Research Library</a> contains
            {articleCount.toLocaleString()} scholarly works, indexed from medical journals, textbooks,
            and clinical references. Most are peer-reviewed; all are catalogued for review. You can
